{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BvjvXkhYwgUiYfTH8fnFXV","type":"tool_result","content":"commit e66e699f17f2b8b88b14c450344fda7011616965\nAuthor: Harikiran Nayak <harikiran.nayak@gmail.com>\nDate:   Sun May 17 21:27:24 2026 +0000\n\n    fix(inventory): prevent TOCTOU race in reserveInventory\n    \n    Re-read actual stock synchronously immediately before the decrement.\n    No await between re-read and write, so the check-then-act is atomic\n    in Node.js's single-threaded event loop — concurrent requests that\n    raced through the processing delay are rejected before any write occurs.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n otel-demo/ecommerce/backend/src/services/inventory.js | 15 ++++++++++++++-\n 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"52df716d-de27-46b1-89e3-0675eb8be203","uuid":"c2df2032-4533-4105-b6a6-7d090b277a35","timestamp":"2026-05-19T18:45:49.026Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"commit e66e699f17f2b8b88b14c450344fda7011616965\nAuthor: Harikiran Nayak <harikiran.nayak@gmail.com>\nDate:   Sun May 17 21:27:24 2026 +0000\n\n    fix(inventory): prevent TOCTOU race in reserveInventory\n    \n    Re-read actual stock synchronously immediately before the decrement.\n    No await between re-read and write, so the check-then-act is atomic\n    in Node.js's single-threaded event loop — concurrent requests that\n    raced through the processing delay are rejected before any write occurs.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n otel-demo/ecommerce/backend/src/services/inventory.js | 15 ++++++++++++++-\n 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
